  /* ==========================================================================
     FACELIFT — PHASE A · Direction A "Editorial Grotesque"
     Appended, not merged: every rule above is untouched and these override by
     source order at equal specificity. Colour/type/space come from --bn-*
     tokens in assets/bn-tokens.css. No new hard-coded values.
